        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Dth calculated using the 1.065 Mcf/Dth conversion factor. Applied to line 2, 3, 4 &amp; 7 also.</span>
